{"products":[{"id":7050034741403,"title":"Blazepod trainer kit","handle":"blaze-pod-trainer-kit","body_html":"\u003ch3\u003eUnleash Your Full Potential with the BlazePod Trainer Kit\u003c\/h3\u003e\u003cp\u003eIf you’re searching for a versatile tool that takes your training to the next level, the \u003cstrong\u003eBlazePod Trainer Kit\u003c\/strong\u003e is your ultimate solution. This game-changing platform is designed to enhance your reaction time, agility, decision-making, and more. Whether you’re an elite athlete, a fitness enthusiast, a therapist, or a coach, BlazePod offers an innovative way to achieve your goals and push your limits.\u003c\/p\u003e\u003ch4\u003eRevolutionize Your Training with BlazePod- \u003ca href=\"https:\/\/www.blazepod.com\/en-intl\/pages\/reactive-intelligence\" target=\"_self\"\u003eReactive Intelligence\u003c\/a\u003e\n\u003c\/h4\u003e\u003cp\u003eThe \u003cstrong\u003eBlazePod Trainer Kit\u003c\/strong\u003e is more than just a training tool; it’s a dynamic platform that adapts to a wide range of uses. Whether you're aiming to improve athletic performance, assist patients in recovery, or engage children in active play, BlazePod’s intuitive design and versatile applications make it the perfect choice. With its focus on enhancing cognitive and physical performance, BlazePod is ideal for anyone looking to improve their reaction time, agility, and overall fitness.\u003c\/p\u003e\u003ch4\u003eProfessional-Grade Features for Peak Performance\u003c\/h4\u003e\u003cp\u003eThe BlazePod Trainer Kit comes equipped with \u003cstrong\u003e6 Pods\u003c\/strong\u003e, providing you with the flexibility to create challenging activities, competitions, and tests that suit your specific training needs. The Pods are designed to be \u003cstrong\u003edurable and water-resistant\u003c\/strong\u003e (IP65), ensuring they can withstand even the most rigorous training environments. Each Pod features \u003cstrong\u003epowerful RGB LEDs with 8 color options\u003c\/strong\u003e, allowing for clear visibility and varied training scenarios.\u003c\/p\u003e\u003ch4\u003eIntuitive and Easy to Use\u003c\/h4\u003e\u003cp\u003eBlazePod’s design is centered on simplicity and ease of use. The Pods have \u003cstrong\u003eno power buttons or moving parts\u003c\/strong\u003e, making them incredibly user-friendly. Simply connect the Pods to your smart device using Bluetooth Low Energy (BLE) communication, which offers a \u003cstrong\u003e40-meter device-to-Pod range\u003c\/strong\u003e. The \u003cstrong\u003eBlazePod App\u003c\/strong\u003e (available on iOS and Android) allows you to easily set up your training sessions, track progress, and adjust settings according to your needs. Whether you’re at home, in the gym, or on the field, BlazePod is portable and lightweight, making it easy to carry and set up anywhere.\u003c\/p\u003e\u003ch4\u003eInnovative Charging and Storage Solutions\u003c\/h4\u003e\u003cp\u003eThe BlazePod Trainer Kit includes a \u003cstrong\u003echarging base\u003c\/strong\u003e and a \u003cstrong\u003espace-saving smart stack \u0026amp; charge\u003c\/strong\u003e system, which allows you to recharge all your Pods at once, ensuring they’re always ready when you are. The \u003cstrong\u003erechargeable Li-Ion battery\u003c\/strong\u003e provides up to \u003cstrong\u003e8 hours of operation\u003c\/strong\u003e on a single charge, so you can train without interruption. When not in use, the Pods can be neatly stored in the \u003cstrong\u003eBlazePod case for 6 Pods\u003c\/strong\u003e, keeping your equipment organized and protected.\u003c\/p\u003e\u003ch4\u003eEnhance Your Training with BlazePod Adapters\u003c\/h4\u003e\u003cp\u003eTo maximize the versatility of your BlazePod Trainer Kit, consider using one of the unique \u003cstrong\u003eBlazePod adapters\u003c\/strong\u003e to lift the Pods off the ground. This feature allows for even more dynamic training setups, enabling you to tailor your workouts to specific sports, drills, or therapeutic exercises.\u003c\/p\u003e\u003ch4\u003eIdeal for Coaches, Therapists, and Trainers\u003c\/h4\u003e\u003cp\u003eThe \u003cstrong\u003eBlazePod Trainer Kit\u003c\/strong\u003e is an invaluable tool for professional sports coaches, therapists, and fitness trainers. It enables you to design customized training programs that challenge your clients and help them reach their full potential. With BlazePod, you can create a wide array of activities that test and improve various aspects of physical and mental performance.\u003c\/p\u003e\u003ch4\u003eJoin the BlazePod Revolution\u003c\/h4\u003e\u003cp\u003eWhether you’re working with top-tier athletes or guiding someone through rehabilitation, the BlazePod Trainer Kit is designed to help you succeed. Its durable design, intuitive features, and wide range of applications make it an essential tool for anyone serious about improving performance and achieving their goals. BlazePod is not just a product; it's a platform that empowers you to unleash your full potential.\u003c\/p\u003e\u003ch2\u003eReady to revolutionize your training? Explore the \u003cstrong\u003e\u003ca target=\"_new\"\u003eBlazePod Trainer Kit\u003c\/a\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e and discover how this innovative tool can help you and your clients achieve peak performance. Pair it with our \u003ca target=\"_new\"\u003eHypervolt 2 Pro\u003c\/a\u003e for a comprehensive training and recovery experience.\u003c\/h2\u003e\u003ciframe src=\"https:\/\/www.youtube.com\/embed\/2GOphyoG7Ig\" width=\"853\" height=\"480\" frameborder=\"0\" allowfullscreen=\"true\"\u003e\u003c\/iframe\u003e","published_at":"2021-09-07T16:54:17+05:30","created_at":"2021-09-07T16:54:13+05:30","updated_at":"2026-08-20T20:16:53+05:30","vendor":"wodarmour","product_type":"Equipment","tags":["spo-default","spo-disabled"],"variants":[{"id":44866516877528,"title":"Trainer kit ( 6 Pods )","option1":"Trainer kit ( 6 Pods )","option2":null,"option3":null,"sku":"BLPOD-TRAINER-KIT","re