ldwide, BlazePod is now available in India through WodArmour — your trusted sports performance partner.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eFor fitness enthusiasts.\u003c\/strong\u003e Includes 4 Pods with plenty of predefined activities and the ability to create your own for enhancing your workouts.\u003cstrong\u003e \u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eWhy BlazePod is the Best Reaction Trainer in India\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]\"\u003eTraditional cone drills and ladder exercises are outdated. BlazePod's interactive light pods respond to your movements in real time, making every session faster, smarter, and more competitive. The \u003cstrong\u003eBlazePod app\u003c\/strong\u003e (free, iOS \u0026amp; Android) gives you 100+ pre-built training programs — or build your own custom drills in seconds.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]\"\u003ePerfect for:\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul class=\"[li_\u0026amp;]:mb-0 [li_\u0026amp;]:mt-1 [li_\u0026amp;]:gap-1 [\u0026amp;:not(:last-child)_ul]:pb-1 [\u0026amp;:not(:last-child)_ol]:pb-1 list-disc flex flex-col gap-1 pl-8 mb-3\"\u003e\n\u003cli class=\"whitespace-normal break-words pl-2\"\u003e🏏 \u003cstrong\u003eCricket\u003c\/strong\u003e — Improve batting reflexes, fielding reaction speed\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli class=\"whitespace-normal break-words pl-2\"\u003e⚽ \u003cstrong\u003eFootball \/ Futsal\u003c\/strong\u003e — Agility, directional change, footwork\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli class=\"whitespace-normal break-words pl-2\"\u003e🥊 \u003cstrong\u003eBoxing \/ MMA\u003c\/strong\u003e — Hand-eye coordination, combo reaction\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli class=\"whitespace-normal break-words pl-2\"\u003e🏀 \u003cstrong\u003eBasketball\u003c\/strong\u003e — Court vision, lateral speed\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli class=\"whitespace-normal break-words pl-2\"\u003e🏃 \u003cstrong\u003eAthletics \/ Track\u003c\/strong\u003e — Sprint start reaction, explosive speed\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli class=\"whitespace-normal break-words pl-2\"\u003e🧘 \u003cstrong\u003eFitness \u0026amp; Rehab\u003c\/strong\u003e — Cognitive training, neuro-activation, coordination\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e \u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e \u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eWhat's in the BlazePod Standard Kit\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli style=\"list-style-type: none;\"\u003e\n\u003cul class=\"[li_\u0026amp;]:mb-0 [li_\u0026amp;]:mt-1 [li_\u0026amp;]:gap-1 [\u0026amp;:not(:last-child)_ul]:pb-1 [\u0026amp;:not(:last-child)_ol]:pb-1 list-disc flex flex-col gap-1 pl-8 mb-3\"\u003e\n\u003cli class=\"whitespace-normal break-words pl-2\"\u003e✅ 4× BlazePod Smart Light Pods\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli class=\"whitespace-normal break-words pl-2\"\u003e✅ 1× Smart Charging Base\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli class=\"whitespace-normal break-words pl-2\"\u003e✅ 1× Carry Case\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli class=\"whitespace-normal break-words pl-2\"\u003e✅ Access to BlazePod App (100+ training programs)\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli class=\"whitespace-normal break-words pl-2\"\u003e✅ Compatible with all BlazePod adapters \u0026amp; accessories\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003ePOD FEATURES\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul class=\"[li_\u0026amp;]:mb-0 [li_\u0026amp;]:mt-1 [li_\u0026amp;]:gap-1 [\u0026amp;:not(:last-child)_ul]:pb-1 [\u0026amp;:not(:last-child)_ol]:pb-1 list-disc flex flex-col gap-1 pl-8 mb-3\"\u003e\n\u003cli class=\"whitespace-normal break-words pl-2\"\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003ePowerful RGB LEDs\u003c\/strong\u003e with 8 color options for varied drill programming\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli class=\"whitespace-normal break-words pl-2\"\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eDurable \u0026amp; Weatherproof\u003c\/strong\u003e — Water resistant (IP65), UV protected — built for Indian outdoor conditions\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli class=\"whitespace-normal break-words pl-2\"\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eSimple \u0026amp; Intuitive\u003c\/strong\u003e — No power button, no moving parts, zero setup hassle\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli class=\"whitespace-normal break-words pl-2\"\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003ePortable\u003c\/strong\u003e — Small, lightweight, fits in any gym bag\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli class=\"whitespace-normal break-words pl-2\"\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eLift-off adapters\u003c\/strong\u003e — Mount Pods on walls, cones, goalposts using unique BlazePod adapters\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli class=\"whitespace-normal break-words pl-2\"\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eLong battery life\u003c\/strong\u003e — Rechargeable Li-Ion battery, up to 8 hours per charge\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli class=\"whitespace-normal break-words pl-2\"\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eSpace-saving smart stack \u0026amp; charge\u003c\/strong\u003e — All pods charge together on the base\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli class=\"whitespace-normal break-words pl-2\"\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eBluetooth Low Energy (BLE)\u003c\/strong\u003e — Instant smartphone pairing, up to 40-metre device-to-pod range\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eBlazePod App — Your Digital Coaching Platform\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]\"\u003eThe BlazePod app connects your pods and unleashes 100+ training modes across sports, fitness, and cognitive categories. Coaches can run team sessions, track athlete performance, and build custom protocols — all from their phone.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]\"\u003ePlease note the app subscription is not included in this package \u003c\/p\u003e","published_at":"2022-10-17T15:45:27+05:30","created_at":"2021-09-07T17:23:07+05:30","updated_at":"2026-08-20T20:16:53+05:30","vendor":"wodarmour","product_type":"Equipment","tags":["spo-default","spo-disabled"],"variants":[{"id":41076050067611,"title":"Default Title","option1":"Default Title","option2":null,"option3":null,"sku":"","requires_shipping":true,"taxable":false,"featured_image":null,"available":true,"price":"43999.00","grams":0,"compare_at_price":null,"position":1,"product_id":7050053648539,"created_at":"2021-09-07T17:23:07+05:30","updated_at":"2026-08-20T20:16:53+05:30"}],"images":[{"id":32403581665435,"created_at":"2021-09-07T17:23:07+05:30","position":1,"updated_at":"2025-09-06T16:09:21+05:30","product_id":7050053648539,"variant_ids":[],"src":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/1311\/6023\/products\/blazepod-standard-kit-wodarmour-1.jpg?v=1757155161","width":862,"height":862},{"id":32403581468827,"created_at":"2021-09-07T17:23:07+05:30","position":2,"updated_at":"2025-09-06T16:09:22+05:30","product_id":7050053648539,"variant_ids":[],"src":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/1311\/6023\/products\/blazepod-standard-kit-wodarmour-2.jpg?v=1757155162","width":862,"height":862},{"id":32403581436059,"created_at":"2021-09-07T17:23:07+05:30","position":3,"updated_at":"2025-09-06T16:09:22+05:30","product_id":7050053648539,"variant_ids":[],"src":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/1311\/6023\/products\/blazepod-standard-kit-wodarmour-3.jpg?v=1757155162","width":862,"height":862},{"id":32403581730971,"created_at":"2021-09-07T17:23:07+05:30","position":4,"updated_at":"2025-09-06T16:09:24+05:30","product_id":7050053648539,"variant_ids":[],"src":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/1311\/6023\/products\/blazepod-stan